cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fd in academic or internal work, please cite it as below."
title: "fd — same-host text embedding API for Russian and legal-domain workloads"
abstract: >-
  A Go service that exposes OpenAI-compatible text embeddings for same-host
  consumers over HuggingFace Text Embeddings Inference (TEI) with the
  deepvk/USER-bge-m3 model, backed by a two-tier cache (in-process L1 plus Redis L2)
  and Prometheus instrumentation.
